== A1 bass system (lumped, + electroacPy cross-check)
=== Validation ===
sealed 2xND65-8 in 0.82 L: closed form fc 140.03 Hz, model |Z| peak 140.04 Hz (Le=0), 139.99 Hz (with Le)
lossless PR notch at fp=32.2 Hz: -137 dB below peak
electroacPy cross-check (same physics): {'spl_db': 0.0127, 'zin_pct': 0.2217, 'xd_db': 0.0249, 'xp_db': 0.0152, 'air_load_effect_spl_db_max': 0.1409}

=== PR added-mass sweep ===
Vb 0.85 L: best m_add 2.50 g/PR -> pink 90.67 dB (amp V)
Vb 0.82 L: best m_add 2.50 g/PR -> pink 90.59 dB (amp V)
chosen 3.5 g/PR at 0.82 L: fb 53.2 Hz, fp 32.2 Hz, pink 90.55 dB (amp V), margins amp V +0.0, amp I +8.9, woofer thermal +8.5, woofer Xmax +1.1, PR Xmax +1.5
  natural F3/F6 120/96 Hz; with EQ 63.7/55.6 Hz; max boost 8.8 dB; DSP sine ceiling 86.5 dB (set by 47 Hz)

=== Biquad realisation of the bass EQ (fs = 48 kHz) ===
  highpass (BW4 stage 1)   fc   49.8 Hz  Q 0.541  gain +0.00 dB
  highpass (BW4 stage 2)   fc   49.8 Hz  Q 1.307  gain +0.00 dB
  low shelf                fc  113.0 Hz  Q 1.028  gain +5.80 dB
  peaking                  fc   65.9 Hz  Q 1.401  gain +2.93 dB
  max |biquad - ideal| 40 Hz-1 kHz: 0.55 dB
  realised with biquads: F3 63.7 Hz, F6 55.3 Hz, max boost 8.8 dB, pink 90.55 dB (amp V), woofer avg 2.39 W

=== What-ifs (PR mass re-optimised for each) ===
